[I] Free Toolkit for developing mapping applications

[T] Mapnik is a Free Toolkit for developing mapping applications. It's written in C++
[T] and there are Python bindings to facilitate fast-paced agile development.

[U] http://www.mapnik.org/

[A] Many http://trac.mapnik.org/browser/trunk/AUTHORS
[M] Aldas Nabazas <baldzius@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[E] opt jasper

[L] LGPL
[V] 4.4.0

[D] 1311aa1f567601fd50c2d7a8c47ecc5c0cecf0211d36033de09f229c mapnik-v4.4.0.tar.bz2 https://github.com/mapnik/mapnik/releases/download/v4.4.0/

var_append cmakeopt ' ' "-DBUILD_TESTING=OFF -DBUILD_BENCHMARK=OFF -DBUILD_DEMO_CPP=OFF -DBUILD_DEMO_VIEWER=OFF"
pkginstalled protozero && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DUSE_EXTERNAL_MAPBOX_PROTOZERO=ON
pkginstalled postgresql && var_append cmakeopt ' ' "-DPostgreSQL_ROOT=$root/$(pkgprefix postgresql)" ||
	var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DUSE_PLUGIN_INPUT_POSTGIS_PGRASTER=OFF

atstage cross && var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBOOST_REGEX_HAS_ICU_EXITCODE=0
